  "known_boundaries": [
    "Physical OceanBase/PostgreSQL, shared physical multi-host ownership and full-scale production acceptance were not performed.",
    "Native index directories have one controlled owner. Private service rebuild budgets and source32 attempt limits are distinct from full tenant-attributed embedding billing.",
